I think the people in favor of STRICT restrictions on weapons are forgetting
one very important thing.....NETHACK IS A SINGLE PLAYER GAME unlike AD&D
where a party of adventurers goes out on a quest or some such.

Others in your 'party', ie the warrior, are not going to be there to shield
the wizard while he prepares to cast his spell of striking.

AD&D is not much fun played alone..NETHACK IS.  

I believe it is possible to mold things in nethack to be similar to AD&D but
trying to make this game follow all AD&D rules is not very realistic.

On day when NETHACK 10.0 comes out and we have a multiplayer dungeon on every
system in the world it could work...but then again....

Just my $0.02
